/- English proof (translation)
Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result. Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the indicated hypotheses using the stated equalities. Establish an intermediate fact. Establish an intermediate fact.

Rewrite the indicated hypotheses using the stated equalities. Separate the alternatives or extract the components of the hypothesis. A detailed English derivation is pending.
-/
theorem norm_eq_one {C : Type} [NormedField C] [IsUltrametricDist C] (u : C)
    (h : ‖u - 1‖ < 1) : ‖u‖ = 1 := by
  apply le_antisymm
  · have h1 := IsUltrametricDist.norm_add_le_max (u - 1) (1 : C)
    rw [sub_add_cancel, norm_one] at h1
    exact h1.trans (max_le h.le le_rfl)
  · have h1 := IsUltrametricDist.norm_add_le_max u (-(u - 1))
    have e : u + -(u - 1) = 1 := by ring
    rw [e, norm_one, norm_neg] at h1
    rcases le_max_iff.mp h1 with h2 | h2
    · exact h2
    · exact absurd h (not_lt.mpr h2)

/- English proof (translation)
Proceed by induction. Treat this case separately. Treat this case separately. Establish an intermediate fact. Establish an intermediate fact.

Rewrite the indicated hypotheses using the stated equalities. A detailed English derivation is pending.
-/
theorem norm_pow_sub_one_le {C : Type} [NormedField C] [IsUltrametricDist C] (u : C)
    (h : ‖u - 1‖ < 1) (n : ℕ) : ‖u ^ n - 1‖ ≤ ‖u - 1‖ := by
  induction n with
  | zero => simp
  | succ n ih =>
    have h1 := IsUltrametricDist.norm_add_le_max (u ^ n * (u - 1)) (u ^ n - 1)
    have e : u ^ n * (u - 1) + (u ^ n - 1) = u ^ (n + 1) - 1 := by ring
    rw [e, norm_mul, norm_pow, norm_eq_one u h, one_pow, one_mul] at h1
    exact h1.trans (max_le le_rfl ih)

/- English proof (translation)
Establish an intermediate fact. Establish an intermediate fact. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Rewrite the indicated hypotheses using the stated equalities. Separate the alternatives or extract the components of the hypothesis.

Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Establish an intermediate fact. Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities.

